{"v":2,"coll":"en","num":64,"id":"hymn_64","title":"BLESSED are the pure in heart","duration":80.746,"voices":{"grace":{"file":"en-64-grace.m4a","bytes":759900,"sha256":"9b8ac9eef9b6e36baf4984825d13f2f026976009fc58cd40c206e06c0bf7d59f","duration":80.746,"segments":[{"key":"1","lines":[{"start":0.35,"end":1.879,"text":"BLESSED are the pure in heart"},{"start":2.499,"end":4.158,"text":"They have learned the angels art"},{"start":4.778,"end":6.452,"text":"While on earth in heaven to be"},{"start":7.072,"end":8.893,"text":"God, by sense unseen, to see"},{"start":9.513,"end":11.47,"text":"Cleansed from sin's offensive stain"},{"start":12.09,"end":13.579,"text":"Fellowship with Him they gain"},{"start":14.199,"end":16.148,"text":"Nearness, likeness to their Lord"},{"start":16.768,"end":18.316,"text":"Their exceeding great reward."}],"start":0.35,"end":18.316},{"key":"2","lines":[{"start":20.086,"end":21.623,"text":"Worshipping in spirit now"},{"start":22.243,"end":23.727,"text":"In His inner court they bow"},{"start":24.347,"end":25.912,"text":"Bow before the brightening veil"},{"start":26.532,"end":28.236,"text":"God’s own radiance through it hail"},{"start":28.856,"end":30.598,"text":"Serious, simple of intent"},{"start":31.218,"end":32.563,"text":"Teachably intelligent"},{"start":33.183,"end":34.945,"text":"Rapt, they search the written Word"},{"start":35.565,"end":37.139,"text":"Till His very voice is heard."}],"start":20.086,"end":37.139},{"key":"3","lines":[{"start":38.909,"end":40.453,"text":"In creation Him they own"},{"start":41.073,"end":42.703,"text":"Meet Him in its haunts, alone"},{"start":43.323,"end":44.961,"text":"Most amidst its Sabbath calm"},{"start":45.581,"end":47.351,"text":"Morning light and evening balm"},{"start":47.971,"end":49.749,"text":"Him they still through busier life"},{"start":50.369,"end":52.511,"text":"Trust in pain, and care and strife"},{"start":53.131,"end":55.532,"text":"These, like clouds o’er noontide blaze"},{"start":56.152,"end"